"IMPLEMENTED v1 (2026-08-12). DEATH: death_system (after hp settles): zero-HP NPCs stop acting (controller + action states removed) and are handed to the deletion timer (same tick; carried items spill to the room) -- dead rats stop nipping. Zero-HP PLAYERS wake from the trance at their checkpoint room: relocated, hp/ep fully restored, fear/courage/braced and action states shed. FOUND+FIXED a real ecs-macro bug en route: entity delete() deleted components in declaration order, and deleting a dirties() component re-upserts its flag, so if the flag component died first the entity kept a dangling total dirty flag and the stats system RESURRECTED zombie components (hp 0/0) for the deleted entity; delete() now removes dirty-flag components last. CHECKPOINTS: optional interactive scenery -- checkpoint_object marker (FlagComponent pair) on fortune-telling blobs (bone dice, scrying bowl, fate deck; new appearance vocabulary); ATTUNE action (new ActionType::Attune + effect; co-located checkpoint object target; 1-round gaze + binding in prod) sets CheckpointComponent to the object's room; new players get their checkpoint set automatically at first placement. GENERATION GUARANTEES: themes gain checkpoints_selector; every map's entrance room receives one themed fortune object AND encounters now skip the entrance -- the checkpoint room is visibly marked and always safe. UI extras folded in (user): pinned bar scrolls horizontally and drops the manual number label (the Button already renders its hotkey). e2e phase 12-death (attune binds; slain vermin fully deleted; death wakes at checkpoint fully restored); ladder 0-12 green, 108 unit tests, clippy 0; dev reseeded. NOT DONE (recorded): unconsciousness as distinct from death; death narration in the event feed; enemy corpses leaving lootable gear."